      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "COWBOY UP (7) turned in a good run last time, finishing in the placings (20.36) at this track in a Maiden. Lines up from box 7 for the first time. Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from an outside draw. Expected to feature in the finish again. ALMIGHTY ZEUS (1) comes off an average effort last start when eighth at Q Straight over 350m behind Overshadow Gunn (20.11) in a Maiden. Reliable out of the boxes and should take advantage of the inside draw. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. TILLY TIME (8) filled a minor placing last start at this track behind Nile Keeping (20.25) in a Maiden. Chased the leaders and with a clean run can be prominent. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Leading player again. MOOSE (3) was out of the frame here most recently but can atone.",
